sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant PWA
  participant API as FastAPI/Realtime
  participant STT
  participant LLM
  participant TTS
  participant Avatar
  User->>PWA: tap mic and speak
  PWA->>API: microphone.started + audio chunks
  API->>STT: streaming audio
  STT-->>API: partial/final transcript
  API-->>PWA: transcript partial/final
  API->>LLM: layered prompt + strict schema
  LLM-->>API: AssistantTurnPlan stream/result
  API->>API: validate and compile allowlisted cues
  API-->>PWA: text deltas + emotion/motion cues
  API->>TTS: spokenText
  TTS-->>API: audio/timing (if supported)
  API-->>PWA: audio + viseme frames
  PWA->>Avatar: schedule against AudioContext clock
  User->>PWA: barge in
  PWA->>PWA: stop audio immediately
  PWA->>API: assistant.interrupted(turnId)
  API->>STT: begin next turn
  API-xLLM: cancel old generation
  API-xTTS: cancel old synthesis
  API-->>PWA: authoritative interrupted

